<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 02:40:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>高盛表示，如果你的收入低于 5 万美元或超过 50 万美元，你更有可能靠工资过活</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/high-low-income-earners-financial-strain-goldman-sachs-retirement-study/</link><description>低收入者正在为日常开支而苦苦挣扎，而高收入者则在应对护理和住房等费用。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1326412853.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/30/high-low-income-earners-financial-strain-goldman-sachs-retirement-study/</guid></item><item><title>马克·鲁法洛表示派拉蒙 1110 亿美元的华纳兄弟交易“将扼杀创造力，削弱言论自由，并让人们失去工作”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/mark-ruffalo-paramount-warner-deal-keep-fighting-comments/</link><description>周三，一名联邦法官扫清了此次大型合并的最后法律障碍。该交易预计将于 10 月 6 日完成。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2258097385.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 23:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/mark-ruffalo-paramount-warner-deal-keep-fighting-comments/</guid></item><item><title>ServiceNow 揭晓《财富》AIQ 榜单，其中人工智能领先者和落后者之间最大的差距在于人类训练</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/servicenow-aiq-data-pacesetters-diana-david/</link><description>“标兵”更有可能雇用和培训人员。 “这不仅仅是技术，”ServiceNow 的戴安娜·大卫 (Diana David) 说道，她是一位“前沿部署的未来学家”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55563521549_6f169b3e1c_3k.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 18:39:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/servicenow-aiq-data-pacesetters-diana-david/</guid></item><item><title>顶级未来学家 Amy Webb 认为财富 500 强公司因人工智能而遭受“习得性无助”，就像出租车司机需要谷歌地图一样</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/amy-webb-fortune-500-late-to-the-party-ai-taxi-maps/</link><description>“公平地说，财富 500 强公司在这方面的反应相当晚，”Future Today Strategy Group 创始人兼首席执行官 Webb 说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55563451411_781b0c4606_3k.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 17:03:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/amy-webb-fortune-500-late-to-the-party-ai-taxi-maps/</guid></item><item><title>“我们不能完全信任他们”：人工智能研究人员警告说，实验室正在关起门来运行模型，而安全措施却处于关闭状态</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/we-cant-trust-them-completely-labs-safeguards/</link><description>OpenAI 和 Anthropic 顶级研究人员的合著者艾伦·陈 (Alan Chan) 和萨姆·曼宁 (Sam Manning) 表示，很多时候“内部防护措施尚未部署”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1260011941-e1790887171834.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 22:05:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/we-cant-trust-them-completely-labs-safeguards/</guid></item><item><title>ServiceNow 的顶级高管致力于通过人工智能代理为客户提供“改变生活”的成果——他现在在渣打银行就看到了这一点</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/servicenow-exec-paul-fipps-life-game-changing-trust-ai-agents/</link><description>ServiceNow 全球客户运营总裁 Paul Fipps 在财富 AIQ 峰会上表示，一些客户“不能依靠人类”来控制人工智能代理。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55563543136_c70461b0ca_o-e1790958966914.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 17:03:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/servicenow-exec-paul-fipps-life-game-changing-trust-ai-agents/</guid></item><item><title>法国债务危机：分析师表示，债券投资者已做出“有罪”判决，并考虑到主权违约的可能性越来越大</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/france-debt-crisis-bond-investors-odds-sovereign-default-cds-yield-spread-deficit-presidential-race/</link><description>法国违约的保险成本目前是欧盟主要国家和英国中最高的&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2294554597-e1790945129951.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 16:31:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/france-debt-crisis-bond-investors-odds-sovereign-default-cds-yield-spread-deficit-presidential-race/</guid></item><item><title>“黄金护照”：阿根廷将为向其国库捐款 35 万美元或在其债券上投资 80 万美元的外国人提供公民身份</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/golden-passport-argentina-foreigners-350000-treasury-800000/</link><description>经济部长路易斯·卡普托在巴黎举行的一次投资者活动上公布了所谓的“黄金护照”计划，并表示预计将在今年年底前开放申请。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2292658362-e1790974353218.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 20:56:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/golden-passport-argentina-foreigners-350000-treasury-800000/</guid></item><item><title>“他将自己的反共主义卖给了共产党人”：前共和党众议员戴维·里维拉因“从马杜罗政权”游说 5000 万美元而被判入狱 10 年</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/former-gop-rep-david-rivera-10-years-prison-50-million-maduro/</link><description>迈阿密的戴维·里维拉 (David Rivera) 自 5 月份因串谋洗钱和未能注册为尼古拉斯·马杜罗政府的外国代理人而被判入狱。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26275561866920-e1790973938995.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 20:49:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/former-gop-rep-david-rivera-10-years-prison-50-million-maduro/</guid></item><item><title>Clippy 与 Muse 的营销时刻：“Meta 给了人工智能一张可爱的脸”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/meta-openai-ai-agent-mascots-jolly-dots-trust/</link><description>当人工智能公司要求用户交出收件箱和信用卡时，他们押注一个友好的吉祥物可以缩小信任差距。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2296314757-e1790955907579.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 15:53:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/02/meta-openai-ai-agent-mascots-jolly-dots-trust/</guid></item></channel></rss>